# Low-memory kernel checks (`Design/RationalStellaratorGCEw1CheckH67`)

The checks of `Design/RationalStellaratorGCEw1CheckH67` in the low-memory format
(`Certificates/KronLowMemCompute`): each `k*S_*`, `c*S_*` theorem is one kernel evaluation of
